# Third-party notices

ulnclaw is an independent project: the Rust engine (`src/`, `Cargo.toml`) is
original work by the ulnclaw maintainers — its architecture, tool registry,
scheduler, storage layer and CLI are designed and written in Rust for ulnclaw
itself. Feature coverage that overlaps with the hermes-agent tool surface is
tracked in `docs/en/hermes-parity.md` / `docs/zh/hermes-parity.md`.

